Some dude walks past you and hits you by the shoulder...

"Sorry this was an accident..." he says as he continues on his way...
<<set $coinsloss to random(450)>>\
<<set $Coins -= $coinsloss>>\
<<if $Coins < 0>>\
<<set $Coins to 0>>\
<</if>>\
Later on you realize that $coinsloss coins are missing from you...

<<if $INT >= 2>>\
<<linkreplace "Check youself">> You decided to check if something is missing from you. You realize that you are $coinsloss short so you run back.
"Hey there. Seems like you stole something from me." You say as you draw your weapon...
"WAIT WAIT NO! TAKE IT BACK!" The thief says back, throwing your coins back. <<set $Coins += $coinsloss>><</linkreplace>>
<</if>>\
<<link "Continue">>
<<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
<</link>>
<<elseif _randomencounter1 lte 70>>\
You see a snowball flying at you mach 10 speed, it hits you right in the head throwing you across the entire street.
A buff giant man comes to you. His nametag appears and you see a worried "Bob", he is shivering in fear. "Are you ok!? Im so sorry! This was meant to hit my friend!" he asks in a panicked voice. You stand up... Your whole body hurts. How the fuck did he throw that snowball that fast? "Please take this as a sorry." he says, pulling out a rose out of his inventory and handing it to you and runs away awkwardly...

You are extremely confused.

<<link "Continue">>
<<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
<</link>>
<<elseif _randomencounter1 lte 80>>\
A man lays on the floor, staring into the endless sky. He notices you looking at him.
"What's up? Am I in your way or something?" he asks, his voice deep and tired.
"My bad, you're not in my way. Why are you laying on the floor though?" you respond.
"Fell down, don't feel like standing up." He goes back to staring in the sky. "I'm just tired y'know? First life happened now this entire... death game. I lived through the first boss raid but... what about the second? Or the Third?"
You don't say anything back for a good while. "I'm sure you'll manage. If not you can always just stay here and wait, y'know?"
"There's already a player killing guild being organized. They will get stronger. Staying here is an option until they start killing every weak player."
"There are also players hunting said player killers."
"I see... Then i'll put my trust into them, huh."

<<link "Continue">>
	<<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
<</link>>
<<elseif _randomencounter1 lte 90>>\
You hear 2 men speaking.
"Man, that dungeon raid didn't go so well... I'm not gonna be able to recover from that loss for a while. Fuckers took out my entire potions stash." said the first man, he has red hair and hard leather amor.
"For real man... My fucking sword broke! I knew that bastard gave me a shitty sword but I didn't know it was gonna be THAT bad." says the second man, holding out his broken iron heavy sword, his blue hair looked wet. What the hell did they go through?
"Maybe we should head back to the first floor. The mobs down ere are too tough." says the red haired man.
"Gahh this sucks. Here I was thinking that we will make a fortune by going into the dungeon before anyone else. This is not ideal-" suddenly a black haired man with bags under his eyes and a black coat came out of nowhere.
"You called?" he says with a smile on his face.

<<link "Continue">>
	<<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
<</link>>
<</if>>


